{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "e2f8c280c6831976f523502274a16ecba33a98216bbeaede18ee8a1da3e4c76a", "ja": "黒い影", "zh": "黑影", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3d7e779527b9c216f4cc3d69d1541036b3b888a8a274c09dd5a31fdce9151df3", "ja": "トラブル復旧待ちをしていた莉緒とエレナの\n前に、765プロの昔からのライバル、961\nプロの黒井社長が現れ移籍を持ちかける。\nエレナはきっぱり断るが、悩みをかかえてい\nた莉緒はどこか歯切れが悪い反応で…？", "zh": "在莉绪与艾琳娜等待器材修复之时，765艺能\n长久以来的死对头──961艺能的黑井社长\n出现在她们面前，并邀请两人跳槽。\n虽然艾琳娜直接了当地拒绝，心中抱有烦恼的\n莉绪却表现出暧昧不明的反应……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c83b66a4653000e04251c70eb1bdd774a690788cdf3696ad6c1ef7a0fa3e9901", "ja": "ザワザワ……ザワザワ……", "zh": "吵杂……吵杂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "3fd74d7a9c2fe1672441bd1ba9f14471a0c061788900b6a2ace18c29e6fc995f", "ja": "リオ……音、全然戻らないネ……。\nどうしちゃったんだろ……？", "zh": "莉绪……声音完全没有恢复耶……\n到底是怎么了呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "e99b01531f783f1a92f748b4cfcb96f5192436002a7be27753e344136b9ba305", "ja": "ホント、確かに遅いわね……\nでも大丈夫よ、エレナちゃん。", "zh": "的确，真的有点慢呢……\n但没事的，艾琳娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "0b4a3ab0fb18e04dfc0aa77d87bbb1535d57fbba1a1b76f3ac5499e49315db20", "ja": "{$P$}くんがいるんだもの。\nきっと、何とかしてくれるわ！", "zh": "因为有{$P$}在嘛，\n他一定会为我们做点什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1004_kuroi", "source_sha256": "da02ecc9e95d5bc427c1101cee822c67ed752d97c29bd4d68a4f5881238928c9", "ja": "いやはや、会場の音響設備もまともに管理できないとは\nあきれたものだ。", "zh": "唉呀唉呀，连会场的音响设备都管理不好，\n真令人傻眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1006_kuroi", "source_sha256": "904d14fed87624e1ee4a34b7c372f9f143f442faa8c976174e7eb79e30e1f42d", "ja": "さすがは底辺765プロ。所属するプロデューサーも、\nなかなかの無能っぷりじゃないか。ハーッハッハッハ！", "zh": "不愧是低等的765艺能，事务所的制作人\n看来也相当无能嘛，哈──哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "1055b535af46888360f3877b9b55e78fc5bb2f99b2dc8ba8f5abb23e94b4ac22", "ja": "ひゃっ！？\nこ、この真っ黒なオジさん……誰っ？", "zh": "呀！？\n这、这位黑漆漆的大叔……是谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "bf6dbf6aae1894705f25038a8b865acc2b6f17e80a9f959b8ede0c4a84b67194", "ja": "下がって、エレナちゃん。\n……あなたは？", "zh": "艾琳娜，你先退后。\n……你是哪位？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1009_kuroi", "source_sha256": "6a9b107c2201db72859f0053e2657d61d807c57d121dd5d44ab46458989dfce6", "ja": "おや、有名貴公子である私を知らないのかね？\n……いや、あのプロダクション所属ではムリも無いか。", "zh": "哦，你不认识我这鼎鼎大名的贵公子吗？\n……不，既然隶属于那间艺能事务所，也不无可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1010_kuroi", "source_sha256": "295f730ee57cdc2743cab48113f1774eee3a0411eb7e28628944a4cb5e0fe22b", "ja": "では、特別に名乗ってやるとしよう。\n私こそが、スーパーセレブにして業界のプリンス……。", "zh": "那我今天就特别告诉你们吧。\n我正是超级名流、业界的王子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1011_kuroi", "source_sha256": "54680b7c9c05d8b49ba2732c94e9c42f9d132600274b7eae3cdcc9be90db2283", "ja": "961プロダクション社長、黒井崇男だ！", "zh": "961艺能事务所的社长──黑井崇男！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "1891fd8314645e9ebad592b6e6388e36e865962452088a3df4b4e4d1ca067e4b", "ja": "えっ！？（？）", "zh": "咦！？（？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "ce03a37b92dd9a204e6e85efc812dd0a1eb558f6ed548dbedcccfee55f287b32", "ja": "961プロって、あの大手芸能プロダクションの？\n……でも、その社長さんが、私達に何の用かしら？", "zh": "你说的961艺能，是那间大型艺能事务所吗？\n……但是那里的社长找我们有何贵干？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1015_kuroi", "source_sha256": "d18bdce6ddb97e3d3269356cd39fee39a4df6538dc0b4f1e3a98223ca1c05cf0", "ja": "まぁ、そうとんがらないでくれたまえ。\nどうしても君達と直接話したくてね。", "zh": "哎，别摆出这么尖锐的态度，\n我无论如何都想直接和你们谈谈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1016_kuroi", "source_sha256": "5a2deb6e4aa6052b5cd63f9356b3c840f2e67d379445b2215bb63fd572c33735", "ja": "百瀬莉緒くん……それに、島原エレナくん。\n君達ふたりとも、961プロに移籍する気はないかね？", "zh": "百濑莉绪……还有岛原艾琳娜，\n你们两位有没有兴趣跳槽来961艺能呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "b7ae83a9d3f95557f5542a452d08d75881c72e7e8c38bc13b80afc03d9257480", "ja": "…………へ？", "zh": "…………咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "d16db6a5c8526d9481a18560a3e72b277787a3442ef12353636e77c6bdd2010f", "ja": "移籍……？　それ、どういうコト？", "zh": "跳槽……？那是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1019_kuroi", "source_sha256": "189f432a2cd5d1da8398223301b0baecd0bedaf9808163dacf0b1b38cfc35362", "ja": "さっきのステージを見ていたが、やはり弱小3流プロ。\n君達の、真の魅力を引き出せていない。", "zh": "我看了你们刚刚的表演，果然是弱小的三流事务所，\n根本没有引导出你们真正的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1020_kuroi", "source_sha256": "6bc8a767a1c929fa9377d8d6285452918888c481a2babb7ca36a8ee8c32e7e36", "ja": "ウチの事務所に来てくれれば、今の2倍……いや、\n3倍の報酬と、最高のプロデュースを約束しよう。", "zh": "只要来我们事务所，就可以答应给你们两倍……\n不，三倍的报酬，再加上顶级的培育方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "cde108c8f53d91a42429bafdeb890684aa25a33dd1a16036375a268b929340d9", "ja": "何をテキトーなことを……！", "zh": "你不要胡说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1022_kuroi", "source_sha256": "d6f2a639c9a7365254e53361b4ace6cfb3b0464f175acc88e74854f5035b3ea5", "ja": "ノン！　すでにビジョンはある。\nそうだな……。", "zh": "Non！我心里已经有打算了，\n这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1023_kuroi", "source_sha256": "443539f488ff334a81d6a2266303e4a3047654f8d70cfede8d1172b7bd00055e", "ja": "君達を、至高のセクシーダンスユニットとして、\nすぐにでもデビューさせよう。", "zh": "就让你们以顶尖的性感舞团之姿，\n立刻出道吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "cbb4f9c6f02871f0c93965f14989a903f75dc741cf7d6eb87754ffb77416c6fe", "ja": "せっ、セクシー……！？", "zh": "性、性感……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1025_046rio", "source_sha256": "fc328de91f741557b89c6648aa4e7cae7e810b433ae14869f8441277ed3cdce9", "ja": "つまり……、もしかして、\n私にその路線の才能があるって言いたいの！？", "zh": "也就是说……你的意思该不会是\n我有走那个路线的才能吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1026_kuroi", "source_sha256": "d129414a21d26dc84540fabe1ddc1e0adb97a1c66b9956c5ad88183fca8a2134", "ja": "ウィ。私の見る目は、どんな一流スカウトよりも正確、\nかつエレガントだ。さあ……どうだね？", "zh": "Oui，我的眼光比任何一流星探都精准而优雅，\n好了……怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "17806a2aa87162f63cd23386d83d788053f8eb5d7dc2ff74e47c8dbdf04d9c62", "ja": "どうもしないヨ！　ワタシ達は\n765プロのみんなで、一番を目指すんだカラ！", "zh": "才没有怎么样！我们要和765艺能的伙伴们\n一起当上顶尖偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "2c537c3378b1d2a8ce72f117d16f3d3ddd9f1108b6d68244729f1529e8716a94", "ja": "そうだよネ、リオ？\n765プロでだって、トップアイドルになれるよね？", "zh": "没错吧，莉绪？\n就算待在765艺能，也能成为顶尖偶像对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "b7df3db26fd1e2e8b4ee4b8427ab4d0da384d76d6a8f275ff40944fe10c4ff10", "ja": "……ええ、もちろんそうよ！　私達は765プロで、\nセクシーダンスユニットを目指すの！", "zh": "……是啊，这是当然的！\n我们要在765艺能朝性感舞团迈进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "df63cc5217a5172a312c44c6cfcea625594dfa95c501f07d44cdaa095e8f3db4", "ja": "も～、リオ！　セクシーダンスユニットじゃないヨ！\nワタシ達のユニットは、ARRIVEだってば～！", "zh": "真是的～莉绪！不是性感舞团啦！\n我们的团体叫做『ARRIVE』啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1031_046rio", "source_sha256": "1e1a480e5d4dbf65c5f5f4fd134f963816bb54300a08ee0912c12aec730701f4", "ja": "はっ！　そ、そうだったわ、つい……！", "zh": "啊！也、也对，我一不小心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "13f25855e8eb88b47b0bd4ea1adcc2f0a6ecd8b2525ab2048ea9dc89c6ca18f1", "ja": "あっ、スタッフさん！　ココに知らない人がいるヨー！\nスタッフさーん！", "zh": "啊，工作人员！这边有陌生人出现喔！\n工作人员！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1034_kuroi", "source_sha256": "b884a81834766bd03eb21f8098fe85754328df05b8c164512301d4b03890c6a0", "ja": "どうやら百瀬莉緒の方は脈アリのようだな……。さて、\nこれからが楽しみだ。ククク……フハ、フハハハハハ！", "zh": "看来是百濑莉绪那边比较有戏呢……好了，\n重头戏还在后头。哼哼哼……哼哈，哼哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1035_null", "source_sha256": "26bad7a9a0e63c7b8e956ffc3986f65b4a48ad74c64be68c4f7a5220d7922633", "ja": "30分後……", "zh": "30分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "697e754b5940c7e389020c1d6f825f8f9352945ecbb70dc440fb70e293156b10", "ja": "結局、機材は直らなかったな……。\nでも、ふたりのおかげで助かったよ。", "zh": "最后器材还是没修好……\n但你们两个可是帮了个大忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "cee53bcca021cc8cd698d0413bcbcf0868ab0d89cd02c08c9de9fc5c6e9fc719", "ja": "歌は最後まで歌えなかったけど、即席握手会はいい\nアイディアだ。お客さん達も喜んでくれたし……。", "zh": "虽然无法把歌唱到最后，但即席握手会\n真是个好主意，观众也都很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "a495f554c4d994db91c6d4b04d0b8c85fb36225d6593ec0b9dd96888fbcb1adc", "ja": "ん？　どうかしたのか、ふたりとも？", "zh": "嗯？你们怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1041_018ele", "source_sha256": "449e7f4fc2d2289847525b8da0884af0c6e8c339914dfb26f0dd861485f22514", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nううっ、怖かったんだヨ～……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n呜呜，我好怕喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1042_p", "source_sha256": "02f82dbe4abaa47741a970a3cade4c9717e397c8e8b91e9b14c30b1bb8a7a13c", "ja": "ええっ！？　え、エレナ！？\nすまない、そんなに心配してたとは……。", "zh": "咦咦！？艾、艾琳娜！？\n抱歉，没想到你会这么担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1043_046rio", "source_sha256": "c984379b16d09b06c282debbaa5c52f7afab04b1dd885b78c610264b85ea3a4e", "ja": "違うのよ、{$P$}くん。\nよしよし……大丈夫よ、エレナちゃん。", "zh": "不是这样的，{$P$}。\n好乖好乖……没事的，艾琳娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "03d13361da8532270acaea0d54396015b243b012ff80869147737eb71c363ce0", "ja": "違う……？", "zh": "不是这样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1045_046rio", "source_sha256": "1fb528aab8814f0746597a614b5dc20a1d1b7fd9fa352b1bb4714659a7dbbcdb", "ja": "もちろん、トラブルのこともあるけど。\n実はね……。", "zh": "当然器材故障也是问题的一部份，\n但其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1083_p", "source_sha256": "d39153505b82857153058c9c08819f85c628b91c55dc4e73676aa08d1cf6d461", "ja": "（引き抜き！？　……いや、業界ではよくあること\nかもしれない。でも……）", "zh": "（挖角！？\n……不，这在业界可能是常有的事，但是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1084_p", "source_sha256": "14ef34f5966b2a081bd72369ee5a17a1b85fbda2dc8bd8cdc77c3f1017140832", "ja": "（話を聞く限り、やり方が強引すぎる。それに……\n何か裏がありそうだ。とにかく確かめないと！）", "zh": "（单就听到的状况而言，他的作法太强硬了，而且……\n似乎有什么隐情。总之要先确认清楚才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1046_018ele", "source_sha256": "9cffeebfa531a5aafe52a894b73f4d26d04198c0e004763727ac17f007faaf0d", "ja": "……っていうコトがあったノ！\nもー、大変だったんだカラ！", "zh": "……刚刚发生了这种事！\n真是的，实在太吓人了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1047_045kar", "source_sha256": "e73410ddee7db285ef7c749a821c2abef322ff2bec7d1804e41fc1404004e6b3", "ja": "そ、そうだったんですか……突然のトラブル……。\n私だったら、フリーズしてしまったかも……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……突然发生故障……\n要是我遇到，可能会直接僵住了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1048_025roc", "source_sha256": "4a78ef89399f8bac46ec7a0f3dd77662b380ad452c06c3ae710f8c1b3df80b24", "ja": "ARRIVEのメンバーを引き抜こうとするなんて、\nプレジデントクロイはマリシャスなエネミーですね！", "zh": "竟然想要挖角『ARRIVE』的成员，\nPresident黑井真是个Malicious的Enemy呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1049_018ele", "source_sha256": "66dfb13fa9cc29dd595ef123d94e78c89576ed06f80ef4903325b41385f963a0", "ja": "もー、失礼しちゃうヨー。\n移籍なんて、考えたコトもないのに！", "zh": "真是的，太没礼貌了，\n我连想都没想过要跳槽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1050_008tak", "source_sha256": "93eef14068fde05240891b4b3786b38b652c82469aa4e29465eafcf5884e89b1", "ja": "災難でしたね……。\n百瀬莉緒も、さぞや心乱されたことでしょう。", "zh": "真是飞来横祸……\n百濑莉绪一定也为此感到心烦吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1051_046rio", "source_sha256": "c9e42c6f96381bff7eda0ca445fe25fc3f062d3ee4c931f54e0b1441f76d38ee", "ja": "え？　ああ、うん。そうなんだけど……。", "zh": "咦？啊，嗯，是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1052_045kar", "source_sha256": "64205e75159850e428a41771bda9b2aa23a0425538a62bcd3376afe1a1dc221e", "ja": "……？　莉緒さん……？", "zh": "……？莉绪姊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1053_025roc", "source_sha256": "85a3755a8cefc78a228bbfd2bd8a6a580624e459e83d735f206118fa0389a9e7", "ja": "それより、{$P$}はどこに行ったん\nです？　このエマージェンシーなシチュエーションに！", "zh": "说起来，{$P$}跑去哪了？\n在这种Emergency的Situation！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1054_018ele", "source_sha256": "53c759b7a6974222c4220ecbb186c7261355a5e0e6e17f461c5d989c0beddbbf", "ja": "ワタシとリオを劇場に送った後、\nすぐに出かけちゃったヨ～。", "zh": "他送我和莉绪回到剧场后，\n马上就出去了喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1055_045kar", "source_sha256": "4e6a345df4b89617dc7cac76a95d999ee0c347e7a550e8d4401efd467f0de08a", "ja": "い、急ぎで、社長さんとお話があるって……。\n今日のこと……かも、しれません……。", "zh": "他、他很急，说有事要和社长谈……\n或许是今天的事……也说不定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1060_president", "source_sha256": "96c6d887e15ba910d7c085dedd3b153fa330f3fa13fc6e1342edf2e4df222b65", "ja": "おお、君！　待っていたよ。\n話は音無君から聞いたんだが、大変だったようだね。", "zh": "哦喔，是你！我正在等你。\n我都听音无说了，情况似乎不太好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1061_p", "source_sha256": "3376b32a46332fd1c5b197d57154d9943a57773b1b460a58745719b96c249cfe", "ja": "はい。それで、961プロの黒井社長の事なんですが\n……社長のお知り合いなんですか？", "zh": "是的，然后关于961艺能黑井社长的事……\n社长认识他吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1062_president", "source_sha256": "2bd70fed351465eaeee515c3d6df1676ddd9410c252afcb41a1a12e60aeba701", "ja": "うむ。黒井とは古い付き合いなのだが、\n少々、色々あってね……。", "zh": "嗯。我和黑井是旧识了，\n但发生了一点事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1064_p", "source_sha256": "244b3f758eacf9111bec2af257e844948f173d7e8f56d7d966aed71810042c62", "ja": "社長が事務所を立ち上げる前からの、敵対関係……！\nそうだったんですか……。", "zh": "两人在社长成立事务所之前就是敌对关系……！\n原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1065_president", "source_sha256": "358cb3f0bbbd846f09493f2070d96c8c1993b8ea0c037b50fb859eb65ee6bd6e", "ja": "うむ。奴からすれば、私のアイドルプロデュース方針は\n甘いということらしい。だが、私もまた……。", "zh": "嗯，在他看来，我培育偶像的方针\n似乎太天真了，但我也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1066_president", "source_sha256": "145453d5e7694dbdae41188083ee36303c6161c0a77e71669c20214042edee9e", "ja": "トップになるためなら手段を選ばない。そんな奴の\nやり方を、認めるわけにはいかないのだよ。", "zh": "不可能认同「为了成为顶尖而不择手段」，\n这种人的做法啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1067_president", "source_sha256": "896683ac07df08d91f0dc935c66646109bfd4673b4f459548a47f13fe7c6489c", "ja": "そう、たとえ……手段を選ばない理由が、\n何かあったとしてもね。", "zh": "没错，无论……是为了什么理由\n而不择手段喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1068_p", "source_sha256": "7ced2a75b978fadb98e8d5044749fc14b39f746893896e5f1064e9ecf9dbef29", "ja": "（社長……）", "zh": "（社长……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1069_president", "source_sha256": "5922b024c1982eb521d838a8dcf8948b870dbec40508ed0d04447fce1387bdd2", "ja": "いずれにせよ、君達には、\nそもそも関係のない話だ。", "zh": "无论如何，\n这本来就与你们无关。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1070_president", "source_sha256": "d962e3d51c1c8d8e9c65acec119092c0de8e0cd245de26912f3fa325fcc3f9ce", "ja": "なのにこんな迷惑をかけてしまって、本当に申し訳ない\nと思っている。なんとかできればいいんだが……。", "zh": "却对你们造成了这么大的麻烦，我实在很抱歉，\n要是能做点什么就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1071_p", "source_sha256": "a0b27d80f285103b679a52e5f307dbdd2d4761364f96ce84f6a81fba3486bf58", "ja": "黒井社長は、莉緒とエレナのことを\nスカウトしてきたそうです。", "zh": "黑井社长他似乎是来\n挖角莉绪和艾琳娜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1072_president", "source_sha256": "aff03dcc5cad7d5a729efd81d8c91d52a7122ebe21abeea11f9245dff93e9cbd", "ja": "うむ、それも聞いた。彼女達をスカウトして、\nアイドル事業に、より力を入れるつもりなんだろう。", "zh": "嗯，这我也有听说，应该是想挖角她们，\n打算更投入于偶像事业吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1073_p", "source_sha256": "0721ac45a84259bac4e6c448ad3a1096597d950ec9604b0b8feb91445c6d11d7", "ja": "しかし、本気なんでしょうか？\n既にデビューしている、他事務所のアイドルを……。", "zh": "但他是认真的吗？\n竟然想挖角其他事务所已经出道的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1074_president", "source_sha256": "4e446a6c6eeed77a7e6ede6d4e0d1abddbd974fbfda7031ecf62ae8f1bc55b9c", "ja": "少なくとも、引き抜きをためらう男ではないことは\n確かだがね。……それとひとつ、気になる話がある。", "zh": "至少他在挖角这件事上的确不会犹豫呢……\n我还有一件在意的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1075_president", "source_sha256": "87f10399784ea9c2183ab0b390d4e8a8c136a1df2c5c594e752b04f8afb584f1", "ja": "今日のイベントでの機材トラブル……。\nこれに、黒井が関係しているかもしれないようだ。", "zh": "今天活动上的器材故障……\n可能也与黑井有关。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1076_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1077_president", "source_sha256": "80a4185343f567ff7a38f6ccf95de8cad637599b6461835a3d9c6ad0f2de7800", "ja": "どんな理由であれ、アイドル達の活動を妨害するなど\n間違っている。黒井の圧力に、屈する気はない。", "zh": "无论有什么理由，妨碍偶像的活动就是错的，\n我并不打算向黑井低头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1078_president", "source_sha256": "824105dbdc74397122bb679dccbbc7321763baf950f2a00d4d061dd34379f679", "ja": "君には苦労をかけるが……公演を成功に導くためにも、\n今後は黒井の動向にも気をつけてくれたまえ。", "zh": "虽然会让你辛苦一点……但你以后也要继续注意\n黑井的动向，这也是为了将公演导向成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1079_p", "source_sha256": "c0dfd4ca86bcee69719e347b72fc3684847d373392ae8f5220a5d2908bd65a5d", "ja": "わかりました。俺が、彼女達を守ります！\nみんなが安心して、笑顔で仕事ができるようにします。", "zh": "我知道了，我会守护她们的！\n我会让大家能够放心、带着笑容工作的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1080_president", "source_sha256": "b9283ce76ba3d811b867f7e4ec2021a76b26d43a62be61d3f92ea3e83741b2bc", "ja": "おお、さすがは君だ！\nアイドル達のことを、頼んだよ！", "zh": "哦喔，真不愧是你！\n偶像们就交给你了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0012_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0012_story_04_1081_p", "source_sha256": "a5e3e8a0e48090f1bd2cbf92394e8cae1487d381629c0ce1b71150afe3412b0d", "ja": "（黒井社長……どうも大変な相手らしい。\nだが、うちのアイドル達を好きにはさせない！）", "zh": "（黑井社长……看来是个难缠的对手。\n但我不会让他对我们的偶像为所欲为！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
